---
layout: base.njk
title: 私の履歴書
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>私の履歴書</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">これまでの仕事の軌跡を振り返り、辿った道筋をご紹介します。</p>
    <div class="author-block">
      <div class="author-info">
        <div class="author-name">瀬谷 均</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="article-wrap">
  <ul class="article-list">
    {%- for article in collections.articles -%}
      <li class="article-item">
        {% if article.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ article.data.image | url }}" alt="{{ article.data.title }}" class="list-thumbnail">
        {% endif %}
        <h3 class="article-title">
          <a href="{{ article.url | url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        <a href="{{ article.url | url }}" class="read-more">続きを読む &rarr;</a>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</div>
